@@@@@@@@
C-FOCAL,1969

01.05 T %2.00
01.10 T "HI THERE. I AM TOLD THAT YOU WANT TO PLAY THE" !
01.15 T "ONE TO TWENTY COUNTING GAME WITH ME.  GOOD LUCK." !
01.17 T "OK HERE "
01.20 T "IS HOW IT GOES.  A PLAYER STARTS BY TAKING ONE" !
01.25 T "OR TWO NUMBERS.  IN OTHER WORDS TAKING A ONE OR TWO" !
01.30 T "BEGINS THE GAME.  THE NEXT PLAYER COUNTS UP ONE OR" !
01.32 T "TWO NUMBERS FROM WHERE THE LAST PLAYER LEFT OFF." !
01.35 T "HERE IS A SAMPLE GAME." !!
01.40 T "I CHOOSE 1.  YOU CAN THEN TAKE A 2 OR 3." !
01.42 T "YOU TAKE 3. I CAN THEN TAKE FOUR OR FIVE." !
01.45 T "OK. THE IDEA IS WHOEVER SAYS TWENTY WINS." !
01.47 T "IN PLAYING WITH ME JUST HIT THE NUMBER YOU" !
01.48 T "COUNT UP TO NOT BOTH NUMBERS IF YOU TAKE TWO" !
01.49 T "NUMBERS ABOVE MINE." !!
01.50 T "IF YOU ARE READY, HIT 1; OTHERWISE 0" !
01.55 A N
01.60 I (N-1)1.17,1.70,1.17
01.70 T "IF YOU WANT TO GO FIRST HIT 1; OTHERWISE 2" !
01.72 A N
01.75 I (N-1)5.10,3.05,2.10

02.10 SET N=2
02.12 T "I CHOOSE  "  N
02.13 T !; T "YOUR CHOICE" !
02.15 ASK B
02.20 I (B-(N+1))5.10,2.25,2.50
02.25 S N=N+3
02.30 I (N-20)2.12,6.10,2.12
02.50 I (B-(N+2))5.10,2.25,5.10

03.05 S A=O
03.10 T "YOUR CHOICE." !
03.15 ASK B
03.20 I (B-1)5.10,2.10,3.25
03.25 I (B-2)5.10,3.28,5.10
03.28 S N=3
03.29 I (A-20)3.30,4.10,5.10
03.30 T "I CHOOSE"; T N; T !
03.35 T "YOUR CHOICE"; T ! ; A A
03.40 I (A-(N+1))5.10,3.45,3.50
03.45 S N=N+2
03.47 GOTO 2.12
03.50 I (A-(N+2))5.10,3.55,5.10
03.55 S N=N+3
03.60 GOTO 3.29

04.10 T "OK  YOU WIN THIS TIME."
04.15 GOTO 6.40

05.10 T "CHEAT.  ARE YOU THAT LOW THAT YOU WOULD CHEAT ME?" !
05.15 T "I AM NOT EVEN HUMAN." !
05.20 GOTO 6.40

06.10 T "I CHOOSE 20." !
06.15 T "I WIN." !
06.40 T "IF YOU WANT TO PLAY AGAIN HIT 1; OTHERWISE 0" !
06.45 A N
06.50 I (N-1)6.55,1.70,6.55
06.55 Q
*@@@@@@@@@@@@@@@@@@@@@@@@@@@@@@@@@@@@@@xx